Description:  1 in the middle. When wearing SCP-5819, humans and gorillas begin to shrink until they’re so small, they’re invisible to the naked eye. When any other animal wears SCP-5819, they will grow until they either grow so big the ground beneath them can’t handle it’s mass and collapses or they die. SCP-5819 is observed to change size along with the subject until taken off. When SCP-5819 is took off a subject, the effect still remains.

SCP-5819-A is the amulet itself. When held in a subject’s hand2, SCP-5819-A begins to shake vigorously. When took out of the subject’s hand, the effect remains for approximately a week. SCP-5819-B is the chain that let a subject wear SCP-5819 around their neck. When placed around the neck of a subject, the same effect as the former SCP-5819 occurs. SCP-5819-3 was the ruby in SCP-5819, see Incident-5819.

